1
00:01:38,160 --> 00:01:39,680
This time, the Yufeng Battalion

2
00:01:39,680 --> 00:01:40,840
deployed for sea training in the Southeast.

3
00:01:41,440 --> 00:01:43,040
Not only did they successfully complete

4
00:01:43,200 --> 00:01:44,760
various sea-crossing and island-landing

5
00:01:44,760 --> 00:01:45,680
offensive and defensive drills,

6
00:01:46,520 --> 00:01:48,400
but they also coordinated with academies

7
00:01:48,560 --> 00:01:50,240
and military production units

8
00:01:50,240 --> 00:01:51,600
to complete their respective tasks.

9
00:01:52,200 --> 00:01:52,920
Excellent work.

10
00:01:55,000 --> 00:01:55,800
However,

11
00:01:56,120 --> 00:01:57,240
what is even more commendable

12
00:01:58,760 --> 00:02:00,840
is that they assisted local police

13
00:02:01,120 --> 00:02:02,480
in jointly taking down

14
00:02:02,480 --> 00:02:04,160
a high-tech

15
00:02:04,160 --> 00:02:04,920
drug trafficking syndicate,

16
00:02:05,280 --> 00:02:06,560
and successfully rescued the hostages.

17
00:02:07,840 --> 00:02:08,960
Highly commendable.

18
00:02:10,280 --> 00:02:10,800
Brigade Commander Xu,

19
00:02:10,800 --> 00:02:12,640
you left out one hero.

20
00:02:13,200 --> 00:02:13,720
Yes.

21
00:02:14,560 --> 00:02:15,720
The heroes of this operation,

22
00:02:16,680 --> 00:02:18,560
apart from the troops of Yufeng Battalion,

23
00:02:19,120 --> 00:02:20,480
also include our Red First Battalion's

24
00:02:20,680 --> 00:02:22,320
former recon squad leader,

25
00:02:22,320 --> 00:02:23,120
Comrade Wu Dongsheng.

26
00:02:24,560 --> 00:02:27,080
The Ministry of Veterans Affairs issued a document

27
00:02:27,600 --> 00:02:30,360
commending Comrade Wu Dongsheng's heroic deeds.

28
00:02:30,760 --> 00:02:31,440
Excellent.

29
00:02:32,440 --> 00:02:33,320
The higher authorities,

30
00:02:33,320 --> 00:02:34,720
regarding your operation this time,

31
00:02:34,720 --> 00:02:35,640
are extremely satisfied.

32
00:02:35,840 --> 00:02:38,560
The People's Army will always be the protector of the people.

33
00:02:38,840 --> 00:02:40,760
The Commissar and I discussed it,

34
00:02:41,200 --> 00:02:42,240
and we're giving you two days off.

35
00:02:42,840 --> 00:02:44,000
Get some good rest.

36
00:02:44,000 --> 00:02:44,920
Relax a bit.

37
00:02:45,400 --> 00:02:46,160
Get some sleep.

38
00:02:48,480 --> 00:02:49,080
Stand up!

39
00:02:50,280 --> 00:02:51,720
Thank you, Chief!

40
00:02:52,440 --> 00:02:53,160
Salute!

41
00:03:16,160 --> 00:03:17,800
Aren't we being a bit too lax?

42
00:03:18,320 --> 00:03:20,000
We should still maintain our combat readiness, right?

43
00:03:21,120 --> 00:03:22,520
I know what you're worried about.

44
00:03:23,280 --> 00:03:24,560
But the Brigade Commander himself said

45
00:03:24,760 --> 00:03:26,200
to give the Yufeng Battalion two days off.

46
00:03:27,600 --> 00:03:29,560
We have to let everyone get some rest.

47
00:03:30,040 --> 00:03:31,040
If they're always this tense,

48
00:03:31,120 --> 00:03:32,560
they're going to snap eventually.

49
00:03:33,400 --> 00:03:34,880
Besides, I've replaced tonight's sentries

50
00:03:34,880 --> 00:03:36,280
with our core personnel.

51
00:03:37,040 --> 00:03:38,200
Security hasn't loosened up,

52
00:03:38,280 --> 00:03:39,640
and our combat readiness measures are still in place.

53
00:03:40,000 --> 00:03:41,320
So there shouldn't be any issues.

54
00:03:42,560 --> 00:03:43,760
You go back and get some rest.

55
00:03:43,760 --> 00:03:45,160
I'll go check on the motor pool.

56
00:03:45,640 --> 00:03:46,920
Alright. If anything happens,

57
00:03:46,920 --> 00:03:47,800
let me know immediately.

58
00:03:47,800 --> 00:03:48,320
Okay.

59
00:03:52,560 --> 00:03:53,200
Honey,

60
00:03:53,400 --> 00:03:55,040
the commander gave us two days off starting tomorrow.

61
00:03:55,040 --> 00:03:56,160
I want to wake up early

62
00:03:56,160 --> 00:03:57,400
and hurry to the supermarket

63
00:03:57,400 --> 00:03:58,760
to make a nice meal for you guys.

64
00:04:00,520 --> 00:04:01,160
So, um,

65
00:04:01,160 --> 00:04:03,240
could you send me a WeChat red packet

66
00:04:03,240 --> 00:04:04,480
for a hundred first?

67
00:04:06,440 --> 00:04:07,360
Great, thanks, honey!

68
00:04:08,040 --> 00:04:09,200
That goose stew I made last time,

69
00:04:09,200 --> 00:04:10,320
do you want to have it again?

70
00:04:12,120 --> 00:04:13,800
Then could you make that red packet

71
00:04:14,040 --> 00:04:15,280
two hundred instead?

72
00:04:16,920 --> 00:04:18,000
Awesome, thanks, honey!

73
00:04:18,360 --> 00:04:18,800
Alright.

74
00:04:19,040 --> 00:04:19,800
You hang up first.

75
00:04:19,800 --> 00:04:20,920
I'm going to sleep soon too.

76
00:04:21,040 --> 00:04:21,560
Bye.

77
00:04:29,840 --> 00:04:30,800
You're on duty.

78
00:04:30,880 --> 00:04:31,840
Stop yawning.

79
00:04:32,000 --> 00:04:33,600
Platoon Leader, you have to trust science.

80
00:04:34,240 --> 00:04:35,280
Scientifically speaking,

81
00:04:35,800 --> 00:04:37,680
yawning can't be controlled.

82
00:04:37,680 --> 00:04:38,480
Besides,

83
00:04:38,480 --> 00:04:39,640
it's our own camp.

84
00:04:42,200 --> 00:04:42,760
See?

85
00:04:45,160 --> 00:04:46,040
Look sharp.

86
00:04:47,960 --> 00:04:48,960
Keep an eye on things here.

87
00:04:49,400 --> 00:04:50,600
I'm going to go check over there.

88
00:04:51,040 --> 00:04:52,080
Don't worry, Platoon Leader.

89
00:04:52,600 --> 00:04:53,720
Keep your eyes peeled.

90
00:05:11,280 --> 00:05:11,960
Xiaoshan,

91
00:05:12,400 --> 00:05:13,000
What's up?

92
00:05:13,520 --> 00:05:14,080
Brother,

93
00:05:15,280 --> 00:05:17,600
I've resolved Wu Dongsheng's issue

94
00:05:17,600 --> 00:05:18,920
once and for all.

95
00:05:19,920 --> 00:05:21,480
What do you mean "once and for all"?

96
00:05:21,880 --> 00:05:22,800
What did you do to him?

97
00:05:23,320 --> 00:05:25,320
I sorted out his love life.

98
00:05:25,320 --> 00:05:26,200
How's that for "once and for all"?

99
00:05:26,600 --> 00:05:28,280
Chen Xiaoshan, stop messing around.

100
00:05:28,920 --> 00:05:30,000
Don't just casually

101
00:05:30,000 --> 00:05:31,800
set him up with unreliable girls.

102
00:05:34,160 --> 00:05:35,600
Then do you think I

103
00:05:35,600 --> 00:05:36,680
am reliable?

104
00:05:37,080 --> 00:05:38,160
You're even more unreliable.

105
00:05:38,840 --> 00:05:39,280
Wait,

106
00:05:39,760 --> 00:05:40,680
what's that supposed to mean?

107
00:05:41,600 --> 00:05:43,280
Don't let one heroic rescue

108
00:05:43,280 --> 00:05:44,800
confuse your feelings for him.

109
00:05:45,120 --> 00:05:46,320
Do you even know the difference

110
00:05:46,760 --> 00:05:48,600
between gratitude and love?

111
00:05:49,040 --> 00:05:50,560
I'm a grown woman now.

112
00:05:50,560 --> 00:05:51,640
You think I can't tell the difference?

113
00:05:51,640 --> 00:05:52,960
Then all my past relationships

114
00:05:52,960 --> 00:05:54,040
would've been for nothing.

115
00:05:54,920 --> 00:05:57,000
I'm just afraid it's a passing phase for you,

116
00:05:57,680 --> 00:05:59,200
and later you'll suddenly lose interest,

117
00:05:59,200 --> 00:06:00,320
and just walk away.

118
00:06:00,320 --> 00:06:01,400
Then what about Wu Dongsheng?

119
00:06:01,400 --> 00:06:02,160
Brother,

120
00:06:02,360 --> 00:06:03,640
get your facts straight.

121
00:06:03,640 --> 00:06:04,800
I'm your sister.

122
00:06:04,800 --> 00:06:07,200
Shouldn't you be worried about me getting hurt?

123
00:06:07,640 --> 00:06:09,240
I know what kind of man Wu Dongsheng is.

124
00:06:10,080 --> 00:06:11,240
He's loyal to his career,

125
00:06:11,720 --> 00:06:12,720
and he's the same with people.

126
00:06:13,160 --> 00:06:14,600
Once he falls for you,

127
00:06:14,880 --> 00:06:16,600
he'll treat you well with all his heart.

128
00:06:16,640 --> 00:06:17,480
Even if

129
00:06:17,480 --> 00:06:18,520
it means sacrificing himself,

130
00:06:18,520 --> 00:06:19,760
he would never hurt anyone.

131
00:06:20,520 --> 00:06:21,160
Brother,

132
00:06:21,840 --> 00:06:22,760
as you know,

133
00:06:23,680 --> 00:06:24,920
everything you just said

134
00:06:24,920 --> 00:06:26,520
is exactly why I love him.

135
00:06:27,280 --> 00:06:28,520
A good man like him

136
00:06:28,520 --> 00:06:29,440
in this day and age

137
00:06:29,440 --> 00:06:30,920
is incredibly rare.

138
00:06:31,280 --> 00:06:33,160
Of course, I won't let anyone else steal him away.

139
00:06:33,160 --> 00:06:34,760
I have to hold on to him tightly.

140
00:06:35,080 --> 00:06:35,760
Silly girl.

141
00:06:36,160 --> 00:06:37,480
If you're really determined to win him over,

142
00:06:37,680 --> 00:06:38,960
you need to take it steady.

143
00:06:39,400 --> 00:06:41,480
Please, I'm Chen Xiaoshan.

144
00:06:41,600 --> 00:06:42,760
You can rest easy.

145
00:06:42,920 --> 00:06:44,320
I have everything under control.

146
00:06:46,040 --> 00:06:46,640
Let me tell you,

147
00:06:46,640 --> 00:06:47,400
with the way you are,

148
00:06:47,440 --> 00:06:48,840
he might not even be into you.

149
00:06:49,600 --> 00:06:50,040
Stop right there.

150
00:06:50,720 --> 00:06:53,040
Just figure out whose side you're on,

151
00:06:53,040 --> 00:06:53,760
and we'll be fine.

152
00:06:54,120 --> 00:06:54,720
Alright,

153
00:06:54,880 --> 00:06:55,640
I'm done talking to you.

154
00:07:02,840 --> 00:07:04,720
Looks like Wu Dongsheng is becoming my brother-in-law.

155
00:08:28,800 --> 00:08:29,720
What's going on?

156
00:08:29,720 --> 00:08:31,160
The helicopters outside are so loud.

157
00:08:31,160 --> 00:08:32,400
How is anyone supposed to sleep?

158
00:08:33,120 --> 00:08:33,880
Who are you?

159
00:08:33,880 --> 00:08:34,960
Don't move!

160
00:09:23,520 --> 00:09:24,160
Mountain Eagle.

161
00:09:24,280 --> 00:09:25,200
This is Honey Badger.

162
00:09:26,960 --> 00:09:28,800
I'm in the woods to the right behind the building.

163
00:09:29,160 --> 00:09:30,040
Awaiting orders.

164
00:09:30,520 --> 00:09:32,360
Immediately contact the independently garrisoned

165
00:09:32,800 --> 00:09:34,120
long-range artillery and army aviation detachments.

166
00:09:34,160 --> 00:09:35,360
Be ready to counterattack at any time.

167
00:09:35,560 --> 00:09:36,040
Copy that.

168
00:09:36,840 --> 00:09:38,480
Comrades of Yufeng Battalion,

169
00:09:40,480 --> 00:09:42,240
I have good news for you.

170
00:09:44,080 --> 00:09:46,960
At 1:04 a.m. Beijing Time,

171
00:09:47,480 --> 00:09:48,320
you

172
00:09:48,800 --> 00:09:52,280
gloriously became POWs of Jufeng Battalion.

173
00:09:52,440 --> 00:09:53,120
Report!

174
00:09:53,440 --> 00:09:54,280
Battalion Commander Jiang,

175
00:09:54,400 --> 00:09:55,440
you're playing dirty!

176
00:09:55,440 --> 00:09:57,400
What kind of hero uses a sneak attack?

177
00:09:58,520 --> 00:09:59,520
Sneak attacks

178
00:10:00,720 --> 00:10:02,960
are your Battalion Commander Guo's specialty.

179
00:10:03,640 --> 00:10:05,560
I'm just using his own tricks.

180
00:10:05,880 --> 00:10:07,360
Giving him a taste

181
00:10:08,040 --> 00:10:09,560
of his own medicine.

182
00:10:10,760 --> 00:10:12,760
It was you who let your guard down,

183
00:10:13,400 --> 00:10:15,320
which gave us the opportunity.

184
00:10:15,440 --> 00:10:15,960
Report!

185
00:10:16,120 --> 00:10:17,600
we haven't found Guo Zijian.

186
00:10:25,920 --> 00:10:27,000
Guo Zijian,

187
00:10:29,200 --> 00:10:30,720
I know you're nearby.

188
00:10:32,720 --> 00:10:33,680
Come out.

189
00:10:34,240 --> 00:10:36,600
Face this fair and square, like a man.

190
00:10:36,680 --> 00:10:38,520
Face your own defeat,

191
00:10:39,480 --> 00:10:41,760
and stand with your comrades.

192
00:10:42,760 --> 00:10:44,360
Share the blessings,

193
00:10:45,360 --> 00:10:46,680
and share the burdens.

194
00:10:48,760 --> 00:10:50,360
Slipping away by yourself

195
00:10:51,600 --> 00:10:54,240
is not the style of a commander.

196
00:10:55,240 --> 00:10:55,920
Mountain Eagle,

197
00:10:56,640 --> 00:10:58,200
Honey Badger here. I can't reach anyone.

198
00:10:59,240 --> 00:10:59,760
Honey Badger,

199
00:11:00,640 --> 00:11:01,920
prepare for the next plan.

200
00:11:02,160 --> 00:11:02,680
Move out.

201
00:11:03,240 --> 00:11:03,720
Copy that.

202
00:11:04,000 --> 00:11:04,840
Guo Zijian,

203
00:11:05,320 --> 00:11:06,600
don't waste your effort.

204
00:11:07,320 --> 00:11:08,640
You should understand

205
00:11:09,240 --> 00:11:10,760
that my standing here

206
00:11:11,080 --> 00:11:13,200
means all your combat nodes

207
00:11:13,200 --> 00:11:14,640
have been taken down by me.

208
00:11:15,880 --> 00:11:17,560
I know you still have support fire,

209
00:11:18,200 --> 00:11:20,120
but your comrades are here.

210
00:11:21,760 --> 00:11:23,800
Do you dare to open fire?

211
00:11:26,200 --> 00:11:27,480
Comrades of Yufeng Battalion,

212
00:11:27,960 --> 00:11:28,760
do you see this?

213
00:11:29,240 --> 00:11:30,600
This is your battalion commander.

214
00:11:32,480 --> 00:11:33,800
He abandoned you,

215
00:11:34,760 --> 00:11:37,280
watched helplessly as you became prisoners,

216
00:11:37,440 --> 00:11:39,040
and then, all by himself,

217
00:11:39,840 --> 00:11:41,760
slunk away in disgrace.

218
00:11:42,080 --> 00:11:42,880
Jiang Shengqiang!

219
00:11:46,600 --> 00:11:47,480
Jiang Shengqiang,

220
00:11:48,120 --> 00:11:49,480
If I had a gun right now,

221
00:11:49,480 --> 00:11:50,840
you wouldn't be talking so much nonsense.

222
00:11:51,200 --> 00:11:52,040
Battalion Commander Guo.

223
00:11:52,720 --> 00:11:53,600
Long time no see.

224
00:11:54,920 --> 00:11:55,720
Did you miss me?

225
00:11:55,840 --> 00:11:57,400
You've lost your mind trying to win.

226
00:11:58,280 --> 00:11:59,880
Got nothing better to do this late at night?

227
00:12:02,680 --> 00:12:03,880
Don't take it out on me.

228
00:12:05,160 --> 00:12:06,280
You should think about it.

229
00:12:07,400 --> 00:12:09,560
Would I dare to come to the 396th Brigade's camp

230
00:12:09,560 --> 00:12:10,800
and make such a big scene

231
00:12:11,000 --> 00:12:12,400
without orders from above?

232
00:12:13,600 --> 00:12:15,080
Would I just ask for trouble?

233
00:12:15,240 --> 00:12:17,000
The brigade commander personally said

234
00:12:17,360 --> 00:12:19,520
our Yufeng Battalion gets a two-day leave.

235
00:12:19,600 --> 00:12:22,080
But another commander also personally said

236
00:12:22,800 --> 00:12:23,840
that your Yufeng Battalion

237
00:12:24,600 --> 00:12:27,040
must maintain at least Level 3 combat readiness.

238
00:12:28,240 --> 00:12:29,920
And he specifically emphasized that

239
00:12:30,400 --> 00:12:32,320
without his personal permission,

240
00:12:32,960 --> 00:12:34,520
it cannot be lifted.

241
00:12:37,240 --> 00:12:38,040
Did you forget?

242
00:12:40,320 --> 00:12:42,320
Regarding this operation of Yufeng Battalion,

243
00:12:42,600 --> 00:12:43,600
both the corps and brigade

244
00:12:43,600 --> 00:12:45,240
commanders take it very seriously.

245
00:12:45,680 --> 00:12:46,520
They hope you will exercise

246
00:12:46,520 --> 00:12:48,040
your own initiative,

247
00:12:48,280 --> 00:12:49,200
and no matter what,

248
00:12:49,320 --> 00:12:50,160
fight this battle well.

249
00:12:50,280 --> 00:12:51,080
Yes, sir.

250
00:12:51,600 --> 00:12:52,880
Also, there's one requirement

251
00:12:53,120 --> 00:12:54,360
I must emphasize.

252
00:12:54,960 --> 00:12:56,120
Deputy Corps Commander Liang directed

253
00:12:56,720 --> 00:12:58,080
that Yufeng Battalion, from this day forward,

254
00:12:58,400 --> 00:13:00,360
must maintain at least Level 3 combat readiness

255
00:13:00,640 --> 00:13:02,080
until returning to camp.

256
00:13:02,080 --> 00:13:03,440
And only upon receiving his personal orders

257
00:13:03,520 --> 00:13:04,320
can it be lifted.

258
00:13:05,440 --> 00:13:06,120
Battalion Commander Guo,

259
00:13:07,680 --> 00:13:08,560
I'd like to ask,

260
00:13:10,320 --> 00:13:11,480
if not for that

261
00:13:11,480 --> 00:13:13,520
flawless joint military and police operation,

262
00:13:14,560 --> 00:13:16,360
if not for the post-victory

263
00:13:17,520 --> 00:13:18,320
superiors,

264
00:13:18,560 --> 00:13:19,360
society,

265
00:13:19,440 --> 00:13:21,120
and the media's universal acclaim,

266
00:13:21,200 --> 00:13:22,080
and more importantly,

267
00:13:22,480 --> 00:13:23,840
if the brigade commander

268
00:13:23,840 --> 00:13:25,920
hadn't personally promised a two-day leave,

269
00:13:26,280 --> 00:13:27,400
would you, Guo Zijian,

270
00:13:28,640 --> 00:13:30,880
have allowed your constant state of combat readiness

271
00:13:31,280 --> 00:13:33,400
to suddenly slip tonight?

272
00:13:35,640 --> 00:13:36,280
I know

273
00:13:36,800 --> 00:13:38,960
you still have Yang Maolin pulling the strings.

274
00:13:39,200 --> 00:13:40,120
I also know

275
00:13:41,280 --> 00:13:42,960
you still have some fire strike capabilities

276
00:13:42,960 --> 00:13:45,080
that can turn the camp into a sea of fire.

277
00:13:45,400 --> 00:13:47,120
But your command post is here.

278
00:13:47,800 --> 00:13:49,160
Your comrades are here.

279
00:13:49,160 --> 00:13:50,120
And you yourself

280
00:13:53,400 --> 00:13:54,280
are here too.

281
00:13:57,120 --> 00:13:57,880
Guo Zijian,

282
00:13:59,920 --> 00:14:01,080
you've lost.

283
00:14:03,120 --> 00:14:05,120
Don't you dare tell me about starting over.

284
00:14:05,520 --> 00:14:08,040
Why should I give you a chance to start over?

285
00:14:09,280 --> 00:14:10,840
Just one squad machine gun

286
00:14:11,600 --> 00:14:13,400
can wipe out your entire unit.

287
00:14:16,160 --> 00:14:18,320
What chance do you have to start over?

288
00:14:32,520 --> 00:14:33,440
Jiang Shengqiang.

289
00:14:34,480 --> 00:14:35,440
Cut the chatter.

290
00:14:37,000 --> 00:14:38,080
Attention!

291
00:14:46,400 --> 00:14:47,680
Commander,

292
00:14:48,240 --> 00:14:50,560
the exercise has been successfully completed.

293
00:14:50,560 --> 00:14:51,480
Awaiting your orders!

294
00:14:52,040 --> 00:14:52,600
At ease!

295
00:14:53,040 --> 00:14:53,720
Yes, sir!

296
00:14:55,960 --> 00:14:56,640
At ease!

297
00:15:11,840 --> 00:15:13,120
Truly an eye-opener.

298
00:15:15,080 --> 00:15:15,520
At ease.

299
00:15:18,480 --> 00:15:19,360
Before me

300
00:15:20,040 --> 00:15:21,720
stands such a Yufeng Battalion.

301
00:15:23,280 --> 00:15:24,640
I know deep down,

302
00:15:24,800 --> 00:15:26,200
some of you are definitely unconvinced.

303
00:15:27,360 --> 00:15:29,000
Some of you keep wondering

304
00:15:29,480 --> 00:15:31,040
what Liang Beihua is going to say

305
00:15:31,040 --> 00:15:32,080
to make our lives miserable.

306
00:15:35,720 --> 00:15:37,200
I didn't have to say certain things,

307
00:15:37,400 --> 00:15:39,120
but facing

308
00:15:39,120 --> 00:15:40,520
such a Yufeng Battalion today,

309
00:15:41,200 --> 00:15:42,640
I have to say a few words.

310
00:15:43,880 --> 00:15:45,800
So prick up your ears and listen closely.

311
00:15:48,800 --> 00:15:49,760
Throughout history,

312
00:15:50,640 --> 00:15:51,360
war

313
00:15:52,520 --> 00:15:54,360
has never been about normal conditions,

314
00:15:55,000 --> 00:15:56,720
nor is it about social pleasantries.

315
00:15:57,240 --> 00:15:58,320
Once you put on that uniform,

316
00:15:59,120 --> 00:16:00,280
you are soldiers.

317
00:16:01,640 --> 00:16:03,080
There is no high or low status.

318
00:16:04,640 --> 00:16:05,520
But in war,

319
00:16:06,560 --> 00:16:07,600
someone must step up first.

320
00:16:09,320 --> 00:16:10,920
If an emergency arises,

321
00:16:12,120 --> 00:16:13,600
do you comfortably sit back

322
00:16:14,640 --> 00:16:15,600
and wait for your number to be called,

323
00:16:16,400 --> 00:16:17,640
or wait for a rotation?

324
00:16:19,480 --> 00:16:21,120
Tell me, can you?

325
00:16:21,240 --> 00:16:24,360
No! No! No!

326
00:16:25,200 --> 00:16:26,480
You know you can't.

327
00:16:29,800 --> 00:16:31,000
I remember before

328
00:16:32,120 --> 00:16:33,400
leaving for this sea training,

329
00:16:34,000 --> 00:16:35,280
I issued an order.

330
00:16:36,360 --> 00:16:37,200
The Yufeng Battalion

331
00:16:38,120 --> 00:16:40,480
must always maintain Level 3 combat readiness or higher.

332
00:16:42,640 --> 00:16:43,800
And this order

333
00:16:44,640 --> 00:16:45,720
could only be

334
00:16:46,440 --> 00:16:47,360
lifted by me.

335
00:16:48,640 --> 00:16:49,480
But,

336
00:16:50,440 --> 00:16:51,640
after the brigade leaders

337
00:16:52,080 --> 00:16:53,320
suggested giving you time off,

338
00:16:54,040 --> 00:16:55,520
the commander of the Yufeng Battalion

339
00:16:56,200 --> 00:16:57,240
compromised it.

340
00:16:58,480 --> 00:17:00,840
For the combat readiness sentries that should've been set,

341
00:17:01,240 --> 00:17:02,920
not a single detachment was assigned.

342
00:17:04,280 --> 00:17:05,320
Why?

343
00:17:13,280 --> 00:17:15,000
Because your Guo Zijian,

344
00:17:15,960 --> 00:17:16,960
Commander Guo,

345
00:17:17,880 --> 00:17:18,800
loves his soldiers.

346
00:17:19,760 --> 00:17:21,000
But by doing so,

347
00:17:22,080 --> 00:17:23,800
he also harmed his soldiers.

348
00:17:26,000 --> 00:17:26,800
This operation

349
00:17:27,320 --> 00:17:28,720
was an exercise the group army

350
00:17:28,720 --> 00:17:29,640
had long prepared for you.

351
00:17:30,240 --> 00:17:31,480
Originally, the Jufeng Battalion

352
00:17:32,440 --> 00:17:34,240
was ready to fight a fierce battle against you.

353
00:17:35,160 --> 00:17:36,040
But now,

354
00:17:36,720 --> 00:17:37,800
it's totally one-sided.

355
00:17:38,760 --> 00:17:40,520
It's turned into a game of herding pigs.

356
00:17:41,720 --> 00:17:43,480
The chiefs are all very disappointed.

357
00:17:58,840 --> 00:18:00,520
Jufeng Battalion on the perimeter,

358
00:18:02,200 --> 00:18:04,720
are you secretly gloating?

359
00:18:07,720 --> 00:18:09,520
Take a good look for yourselves.

360
00:18:10,360 --> 00:18:10,440
How many of you

361
00:18:10,440 --> 00:18:11,600
How many of you

362
00:18:12,080 --> 00:18:13,960
have been secretly marked

363
00:18:14,960 --> 00:18:16,560
and turned into potential targets?

364
00:18:25,680 --> 00:18:26,320
Report!

365
00:18:27,240 --> 00:18:27,840
Commander!

366
00:18:28,600 --> 00:18:29,360
I want to say,

367
00:18:30,400 --> 00:18:32,000
no matter how capable Yang Maolin is,

368
00:18:32,480 --> 00:18:33,360
on his own,

369
00:18:34,200 --> 00:18:35,240
what can he possibly change?

370
00:18:35,520 --> 00:18:37,040
I'm not discussing what he can change.

371
00:18:37,800 --> 00:18:38,880
Go back

372
00:18:39,200 --> 00:18:40,280
and use your heads

373
00:18:40,480 --> 00:18:41,680
to reflect on this carefully.

374
00:18:41,920 --> 00:18:42,440
Yes, sir!

375
00:18:44,640 --> 00:18:45,640
I now announce

376
00:18:46,400 --> 00:18:47,440
that starting from now,

377
00:18:48,000 --> 00:18:48,880
Yufeng Battalion

378
00:18:49,280 --> 00:18:50,240
will stand down.

379
00:18:50,720 --> 00:18:51,600
You have two days of leave.

380
00:18:51,960 --> 00:18:52,720
Yes, sir!

381
00:18:53,600 --> 00:18:54,800
Attention!

382
00:19:29,880 --> 00:19:31,120
Jufeng Battalion!

383
00:19:31,440 --> 00:19:32,960
Attention!

384
00:19:34,440 --> 00:19:35,000
Return to quarters!

385
00:19:35,160 --> 00:19:37,920
Right face! Double time, march!

386
00:20:05,120 --> 00:20:06,280
Yufeng Battalion!

387
00:20:06,440 --> 00:20:07,480
Here, sir!

388
00:20:08,280 --> 00:20:09,520
Listen to my orders.

389
00:20:09,760 --> 00:20:10,840
Everyone,

390
00:20:11,280 --> 00:20:12,480
regardless of gender,

391
00:20:12,720 --> 00:20:13,720
regardless of branch,

392
00:20:13,920 --> 00:20:15,040
regardless of specialty,

393
00:20:15,040 --> 00:20:16,120
regardless of position,

394
00:20:16,120 --> 00:20:17,400
in five minutes,

395
00:20:17,400 --> 00:20:20,160
assemble at the physical training ground by unit!

396
00:20:20,280 --> 00:20:21,200
Everyone

397
00:20:21,440 --> 00:20:23,240
will do a ten-kilometer armed cross-country run!

398
00:20:23,240 --> 00:20:25,280
Understood?

399
00:20:25,600 --> 00:20:27,720
Yes, sir!

400
00:20:31,960 --> 00:20:33,320
Staying up in the middle of the night.

401
00:20:34,480 --> 00:20:35,640
Looks like this kid

402
00:20:36,120 --> 00:20:37,280
got worked up.

403
00:20:38,600 --> 00:20:40,800
The Yufeng Battalion has been too proud lately.

404
00:20:41,920 --> 00:20:43,840
If they don't vent this frustration,

405
00:20:44,320 --> 00:20:45,320
who can sleep?

406
00:20:45,760 --> 00:20:46,960
Instead of tossing and turning,

407
00:20:47,280 --> 00:20:48,920
it's better to open an outlet

408
00:20:49,600 --> 00:20:50,720
and let this frustration

409
00:20:51,080 --> 00:20:51,720
out.

410
00:20:53,880 --> 00:20:55,200
The Commissar is right.

411
00:20:55,840 --> 00:20:57,760
This is the true art of commanding troops.

412
00:20:58,960 --> 00:21:00,040
A few requirements.

413
00:21:01,080 --> 00:21:01,640
First,

414
00:21:02,440 --> 00:21:03,440
when running late at night,

415
00:21:03,440 --> 00:21:04,200
no loud noises!

416
00:21:04,600 --> 00:21:05,120
Second,

417
00:21:05,760 --> 00:21:07,480
if you can't keep up, drop out immediately!

418
00:21:07,760 --> 00:21:08,240
Third,

419
00:21:09,320 --> 00:21:10,480
after the training is over,

420
00:21:10,920 --> 00:21:11,680
no need to fall in.

421
00:21:12,000 --> 00:21:14,000
Squad leaders will count heads and take you back.

422
00:21:14,280 --> 00:21:15,040
And then,

423
00:21:15,960 --> 00:21:17,000
take a shower and sleep!

424
00:21:17,520 --> 00:21:18,560
Tomorrow is a day off!

425
00:21:19,120 --> 00:21:20,640
Double time, march!

426
00:21:25,400 --> 00:21:26,960
Double time, march!

427
00:21:36,880 --> 00:21:38,040
He knows when to take charge and when to let go.

428
00:21:38,920 --> 00:21:40,120
He knows when to loosen up and when to rein in.

429
00:21:41,640 --> 00:21:42,440
This kid

430
00:21:42,800 --> 00:21:43,440
has matured a lot.

431
00:21:45,760 --> 00:21:47,000
Knowing how to balance tension and relaxation

432
00:21:47,920 --> 00:21:49,360
is the way to adjust body and mind.

433
00:21:56,600 --> 00:21:57,920
Based on the current situation,

434
00:21:58,400 --> 00:21:59,320
by tomorrow afternoon at the latest,

435
00:21:59,840 --> 00:22:01,680
the entire exercise will be completely over.

436
00:22:02,520 --> 00:22:04,680
This Black Mamba 404th Brigade

437
00:22:04,920 --> 00:22:05,760
is a bit arrogant.

438
00:22:07,280 --> 00:22:08,720
They claimed their combat resources

439
00:22:08,840 --> 00:22:09,960
haven't even been depleted by half,

440
00:22:10,440 --> 00:22:11,400
and they haven't fought enough.

441
00:22:12,320 --> 00:22:13,400
But he didn't expect

442
00:22:13,720 --> 00:22:14,520
that his words

443
00:22:14,920 --> 00:22:16,520
would be captured by the monitoring system.

444
00:22:17,760 --> 00:22:19,760
However, some speculate

445
00:22:20,240 --> 00:22:21,360
that Long Yuanshan

446
00:22:21,640 --> 00:22:23,280
said this on purpose for the directorate to hear.

447
00:22:25,480 --> 00:22:26,800
They do have the capability.

448
00:22:27,960 --> 00:22:28,440
But,

449
00:22:28,920 --> 00:22:30,800
the group army commanders are losing face.

450
00:22:31,480 --> 00:22:32,840
Because organizing the 399th Brigade

451
00:22:32,840 --> 00:22:35,040
and the 404th Brigade in this live-combat confrontation

452
00:22:35,280 --> 00:22:36,760
involves Commander Huang

453
00:22:37,280 --> 00:22:39,200
and Professor Zhang from the National Defense University

454
00:22:39,640 --> 00:22:41,400
jointly promoting a new subject.

455
00:22:41,880 --> 00:22:42,800
I know about this.

456
00:22:43,320 --> 00:22:44,280
Military reform

457
00:22:45,040 --> 00:22:46,800
always requires trials and exploration.

458
00:22:47,080 --> 00:22:47,880
That is why

459
00:22:48,120 --> 00:22:49,200
in this confrontation,

460
00:22:49,640 --> 00:22:52,120
not only have the Theater Army commanders and headquarters

461
00:22:52,120 --> 00:22:53,040
come to observe,

462
00:22:53,400 --> 00:22:54,760
but some related academies

463
00:22:55,160 --> 00:22:57,560
have also specifically sent experts to the exercise site.

464
00:22:58,440 --> 00:22:59,560
I heard that in the directorate,

465
00:22:59,880 --> 00:23:01,360
not only is there a gathering of generals,

466
00:23:01,760 --> 00:23:02,920
but the professors' shoulder boards

467
00:23:03,280 --> 00:23:04,520
are also shining with stars.

468
00:23:10,320 --> 00:23:11,400
What exactly are you trying to say?

469
00:23:12,600 --> 00:23:13,680
If right now,

470
00:23:14,040 --> 00:23:15,240
you can find the right moment

471
00:23:15,800 --> 00:23:18,280
to roll out the Yufeng Battalion's

472
00:23:18,560 --> 00:23:19,560
Value Cube,

473
00:23:20,160 --> 00:23:21,360
then it would completely be

474
00:23:21,720 --> 00:23:23,520
Commander Huang and Professor Zhang setting the stage,

475
00:23:24,000 --> 00:23:24,840
and you putting on the show.

476
00:23:28,720 --> 00:23:31,760
Commander Huang sent you to put on this act, didn't he?

477
00:23:33,880 --> 00:23:34,680
It was

478
00:23:34,960 --> 00:23:35,600
the Chief of Staff.

479
00:23:35,880 --> 00:23:36,840
It's all the same.

480
00:23:37,440 --> 00:23:38,160
The Chief said,

481
00:23:38,520 --> 00:23:39,680
saving the show is as urgent as fighting a fire.

482
00:23:39,920 --> 00:23:41,200
Do you really think this is a show?

483
00:23:42,640 --> 00:23:45,000
The Yufeng Battalion just got back from the southeast coast.

484
00:23:46,000 --> 00:23:47,320
They were pushed hard all night,

485
00:23:48,120 --> 00:23:49,440
and have only rested for a day.

486
00:23:50,280 --> 00:23:52,160
These two days of leave

487
00:23:52,360 --> 00:23:53,560
are very precious to them.

488
00:23:54,320 --> 00:23:56,000
You should at least let these young folks

489
00:23:56,000 --> 00:23:57,240
see their partners or something.

490
00:23:57,480 --> 00:23:59,040
The Chief is aware of the situation,

491
00:23:59,360 --> 00:24:00,280
but at this time,

492
00:24:00,760 --> 00:24:03,360
it wouldn't be appropriate for anyone else to step in.

493
00:24:04,160 --> 00:24:04,960
Besides,

494
00:24:05,480 --> 00:24:06,400
last time,

495
00:24:06,400 --> 00:24:08,880
Yufeng Battalion's urban combat drill with the 404th Brigade

496
00:24:09,600 --> 00:24:10,480
didn't go very well.

497
00:24:11,720 --> 00:24:12,760
If at this time,

498
00:24:13,000 --> 00:24:15,560
they can showcase the results of their field training

499
00:24:15,560 --> 00:24:16,480
on the southeast coast,

500
00:24:17,560 --> 00:24:19,160
it would also help rebuild their confidence.

501
00:24:19,680 --> 00:24:20,080
All right.

502
00:24:20,520 --> 00:24:21,480
Your show is over.

503
00:24:21,760 --> 00:24:22,480
Go back and report.

504
00:24:22,840 --> 00:24:23,440
Yes, sir.

505
00:24:32,880 --> 00:24:33,880
We just got back,

506
00:24:33,880 --> 00:24:35,240
and haven't even settled in yet.

507
00:24:35,520 --> 00:24:37,120
Why must we get involved in this fuss?

508
00:24:39,400 --> 00:24:40,240
For no other reason

509
00:24:41,320 --> 00:24:43,920
than to test the Yufeng Battalion's training results.

510
00:24:44,320 --> 00:24:45,240
Guo Zijian

511
00:24:45,640 --> 00:24:47,160
is no match for Long Yuanshan anyway.

512
00:24:47,800 --> 00:24:49,800
I'm just afraid he'll end up embarrassing himself.

513
00:24:50,280 --> 00:24:51,720
He was a defeated opponent in the past.

514
00:24:52,320 --> 00:24:53,080
But now,

515
00:24:53,720 --> 00:24:54,360
not necessarily.

516
00:24:55,560 --> 00:24:56,440
Impossible.

517
00:24:58,320 --> 00:24:59,520
In the past,

518
00:24:59,640 --> 00:25:01,200
I would've said it's impossible too.

519
00:25:02,120 --> 00:25:03,120
But now,

520
00:25:03,440 --> 00:25:05,160
this wishful thinking of it being 'impossible'

521
00:25:05,960 --> 00:25:08,360
could very well turn into a slap in our own faces.

522
00:25:12,840 --> 00:25:13,520
I admit,

523
00:25:15,960 --> 00:25:17,080
my attitude towards Guo Zijian

524
00:25:18,000 --> 00:25:19,840
was indeed a bit extreme in the past.

525
00:25:20,960 --> 00:25:22,000
Actually, as a person,

526
00:25:23,720 --> 00:25:24,480
he has no selfish motives,

527
00:25:25,520 --> 00:25:27,200
and he dares to take responsibility.

528
00:25:28,640 --> 00:25:29,600
This is something

529
00:25:30,600 --> 00:25:32,200
neither you nor I might be able to do.

530
00:25:33,840 --> 00:25:35,600
How can he compare to you?

531
00:25:37,440 --> 00:25:38,600
Anyway, regarding him,

532
00:25:38,600 --> 00:25:40,520
I still reserve my personal opinion.

533
00:25:55,600 --> 00:25:56,480
In this confrontation,

534
00:25:56,680 --> 00:25:58,960
the 399th Brigade not only brought out all they had,

535
00:25:59,080 --> 00:26:00,800
but was also assigned the Theater Army's

536
00:26:01,200 --> 00:26:02,240
combat support brigade,

537
00:26:02,440 --> 00:26:04,000
and cutting-edge weapons from the intel brigade.

538
00:26:04,200 --> 00:26:05,040
A truly formidable lineup.

539
00:26:05,400 --> 00:26:06,280
But in this battle,

540
00:26:06,640 --> 00:26:07,960
they performed absolutely dismally.

541
00:26:08,680 --> 00:26:10,000
If I remember correctly,

542
00:26:10,400 --> 00:26:11,200
the 399th

543
00:26:11,320 --> 00:26:12,360
is a recent

544
00:26:12,680 --> 00:26:14,960
pilot unit for the Theater Army's systemic warfare.

545
00:26:15,280 --> 00:26:16,080
Last time,

546
00:26:16,320 --> 00:26:18,040
during the systemic warfare demo at Yunlin Mountain,

547
00:26:18,680 --> 00:26:20,040
they left a deep impression.

548
00:26:21,280 --> 00:26:22,960
I remember you, Professor Zhang,

549
00:26:22,960 --> 00:26:25,040
used four keywords to evaluate them:

550
00:26:26,120 --> 00:26:28,320
Vertically and horizontally linked,

551
00:26:28,360 --> 00:26:29,480
Integrated recon and strike,

552
00:26:29,680 --> 00:26:30,560
Flawless.

553
00:26:31,400 --> 00:26:32,000
Yes.

554
00:26:32,680 --> 00:26:33,560
For so many years,

555
00:26:34,200 --> 00:26:35,720
recon, early warning, and perception were hard;

556
00:26:36,040 --> 00:26:38,000
fusing and sharing situational awareness was hard;

557
00:26:38,240 --> 00:26:40,080
command and control linkage was hard;

558
00:26:40,240 --> 00:26:42,120
information network protection was hard;

559
00:26:42,520 --> 00:26:44,480
and precise support implementation was hard.

560
00:26:44,840 --> 00:26:45,880
This was hard, that was hard.

561
00:26:45,880 --> 00:26:48,400
Ultimately, realizing systemic warfare was hard.

562
00:26:49,280 --> 00:26:51,720
The 399th Brigade used high-level system integration

563
00:26:51,720 --> 00:26:53,680
to successfully solve this series of problems.

564
00:26:53,680 --> 00:26:54,440
It was thrilling.

565
00:26:55,720 --> 00:26:56,280
Lao Huang.

566
00:26:56,520 --> 00:26:57,280
But this time,

567
00:26:57,560 --> 00:26:58,640
it was the key to their success,

568
00:26:59,120 --> 00:27:00,160
but also the cause of their defeat.

569
00:27:00,280 --> 00:27:00,760
Exactly.

570
00:27:02,200 --> 00:27:03,960
I think their system integration

571
00:27:04,840 --> 00:27:07,040
only achieved a basic level of connectivity.

572
00:27:07,800 --> 00:27:09,880
But everyone praised it so highly,

573
00:27:11,000 --> 00:27:12,360
that it confused even them.

574
00:27:13,960 --> 00:27:15,000
The 404th Brigade

575
00:27:15,840 --> 00:27:18,400
knew they had the upper hand in this area,

576
00:27:19,160 --> 00:27:21,520
so they must have made targeted preparations.

577
00:27:22,240 --> 00:27:24,400
So it's not surprising the battle turned out like this.

578
00:27:24,920 --> 00:27:26,960
That's because they ran into Long Yuanshan.

579
00:27:27,160 --> 00:27:28,840
With a different opponent, it's hard to say.

580
00:27:30,840 --> 00:27:33,120
If war allowed us to choose our opponents,

581
00:27:33,520 --> 00:27:35,200
we could always find a winning countermeasure.

582
00:27:37,000 --> 00:27:37,560
Lao Liang,

583
00:27:37,840 --> 00:27:38,680
what are you thinking about?

584
00:27:39,280 --> 00:27:40,680
I'm thinking the 399th Brigade

585
00:27:41,000 --> 00:27:42,560
still has a reserve unit they can use.

586
00:27:43,480 --> 00:27:45,080
On the invisible information battlefield,

587
00:27:45,680 --> 00:27:46,640
as for this reserve unit,

588
00:27:47,200 --> 00:27:48,880
I wonder what tactical tricks

589
00:27:48,880 --> 00:27:50,120
they can pull off.

590
00:27:51,920 --> 00:27:53,440
You have to use your best assets where it counts.

591
00:27:54,160 --> 00:27:55,360
Let's wait and see.

592
00:28:01,640 --> 00:28:02,160
Staff Officer Liang,

593
00:28:03,040 --> 00:28:04,600
this is your 3D information platform's

594
00:28:04,600 --> 00:28:05,800
first battle since its establishment.

595
00:28:06,120 --> 00:28:07,000
How about we use

596
00:28:07,160 --> 00:28:08,360
Long Yuanshan's 404th Brigade

597
00:28:08,360 --> 00:28:09,360
to draw first blood?

598
00:28:09,640 --> 00:28:10,200
No problem.

599
00:28:11,080 --> 00:28:13,400
I've been pondering since we got the mission.

600
00:28:13,640 --> 00:28:15,240
If we want to take on the 404th Brigade,

601
00:28:15,560 --> 00:28:17,080
our old tricks won't work.

602
00:28:17,280 --> 00:28:18,360
We must use something new

603
00:28:18,360 --> 00:28:19,480
for it to be effective.

604
00:28:19,680 --> 00:28:20,080
That's right.

605
00:28:20,120 --> 00:28:22,240
Long Yuanshan knows us far too well.

606
00:28:22,440 --> 00:28:24,680
As soon as we make a move, he'll know it's us.

607
00:28:25,040 --> 00:28:25,800
To be honest,

608
00:28:26,080 --> 00:28:27,760
even while staying mobile with the troops,

609
00:28:28,160 --> 00:28:29,240
my mind hasn't been idle.

610
00:28:29,480 --> 00:28:30,920
I considered several battle plans,

611
00:28:31,560 --> 00:28:33,040
but I think the most suitable one

612
00:28:34,880 --> 00:28:36,120
is Operation Diana.

613
00:28:36,920 --> 00:28:38,000
Operation Diana?

614
00:28:52,800 --> 00:28:53,880
Received orders from above.

615
00:28:54,000 --> 00:28:56,640
Sync frequencies with the 396th Brigade's Yufeng Battalion ASAP.

616
00:28:56,840 --> 00:28:57,640
Sync with them?

617
00:28:57,920 --> 00:28:58,960
We've done our fighting,

618
00:28:58,960 --> 00:28:59,840
and now they step in?

619
00:29:00,160 --> 00:29:02,400
We can only blame our poor performance earlier.

620
00:29:03,080 --> 00:29:05,400
I've long heard how incredible Guo Zijian is.

621
00:29:06,080 --> 00:29:07,360
Let's see what he's made of this time.

622
00:29:08,000 --> 00:29:09,320
We're all pilot units.

623
00:29:09,520 --> 00:29:11,800
Let's see what weapons and tricks they're hiding.

624
00:29:12,520 --> 00:29:14,080
It's a good learning opportunity.

625
00:29:14,360 --> 00:29:15,600
Don't be so narrow-minded.

626
00:29:15,800 --> 00:29:16,280
Yes, sir.

627
00:29:16,560 --> 00:29:19,040
The group army sent them as our reserve force.

628
00:29:19,360 --> 00:29:20,880
They must have their reasons.

629
00:29:23,520 --> 00:29:26,280
Now let's see between Long Yuanshan and Guo Zijian,

630
00:29:26,280 --> 00:29:28,200
who adapts faster.

631
00:29:31,840 --> 00:29:32,440
Brigade Commander,

632
00:29:32,600 --> 00:29:33,400
do you think

633
00:29:33,520 --> 00:29:35,000
we should slow down the pace?

634
00:29:35,280 --> 00:29:36,680
To save some face for the 399th Brigade,

635
00:29:36,800 --> 00:29:38,400
and leave a good impression on the observation group?

636
00:29:40,600 --> 00:29:41,880
Why complicate things?

637
00:29:42,320 --> 00:29:45,120
Although the 399th Brigade suffered heavy losses,

638
00:29:45,600 --> 00:29:47,200
its command center

639
00:29:47,400 --> 00:29:49,040
remains completely intact.

640
00:29:49,320 --> 00:29:50,560
And it hasn't been discovered yet.

641
00:29:51,080 --> 00:29:53,040
As long as the brain still exists,

642
00:29:53,440 --> 00:29:54,840
we can't let our guard down.

643
00:29:55,160 --> 00:29:56,360
Without limbs,

644
00:29:56,400 --> 00:29:57,840
what's the use of a good brain?

645
00:29:58,120 --> 00:29:58,680
Tiejun,

646
00:30:00,160 --> 00:30:02,960
I think these recent victories have made you complacent.

647
00:30:04,440 --> 00:30:06,000
The exercise isn't over yet.

648
00:30:06,800 --> 00:30:08,240
It's hard to say who will win.

649
00:30:09,360 --> 00:30:10,520
It's like playing chess.

650
00:30:11,120 --> 00:30:13,400
Even if you have all your major pieces,

651
00:30:13,800 --> 00:30:15,240
but they're out of position,

652
00:30:15,480 --> 00:30:18,280
while the opponent only has a knight and a pawn,

653
00:30:18,960 --> 00:30:20,680
if they are perfectly positioned,

654
00:30:21,440 --> 00:30:22,680
they can still turn the tables.

655
00:30:23,920 --> 00:30:26,000
You mean a crossed pawn acting as a rook.

656
00:30:27,720 --> 00:30:30,880
In future warfare, with almost complete firepower

657
00:30:30,880 --> 00:30:33,040
and long-range strike capabilities,

658
00:30:33,640 --> 00:30:34,720
a small detachment,

659
00:30:34,920 --> 00:30:37,720
if backed by a complete info support system,

660
00:30:38,360 --> 00:30:41,000
only needs to provide a few key strike targets

661
00:30:42,000 --> 00:30:43,840
to completely destroy

662
00:30:43,960 --> 00:30:45,240
a powerful army.

663
00:30:48,200 --> 00:30:49,800
If it were our assault detachment,

664
00:30:49,840 --> 00:30:51,600
I believe we could achieve that effect.

665
00:30:51,800 --> 00:30:52,800
As for the 399th Brigade...

666
00:30:53,120 --> 00:30:53,840
Unlikely.

667
00:30:59,160 --> 00:30:59,640
Report!

668
00:30:59,800 --> 00:31:01,440
Successfully synced with the 399th Brigade's frequency.

669
00:31:01,440 --> 00:31:02,000
Connection established.

670
00:31:02,520 --> 00:31:03,640
Get Commander Wang on the line.

671
00:31:03,640 --> 00:31:04,080
Yes, sir.

672
00:31:05,400 --> 00:31:07,240
01, go ahead. 01, go ahead.

673
00:31:07,520 --> 00:31:09,000
01, copy. 01, copy.

674
00:31:09,920 --> 00:31:11,800
Commander Wang, this is Guo Zijian.

675
00:31:12,320 --> 00:31:13,240
Battalion Commander Guo, hello.

676
00:31:13,720 --> 00:31:14,760
You've seen the situation.

677
00:31:15,400 --> 00:31:17,320
The Red Force's situation is not optimistic right now.

678
00:31:17,320 --> 00:31:18,400
What's your plan?

679
00:31:19,360 --> 00:31:20,040
Commander Wang,

680
00:31:20,240 --> 00:31:21,240
per Exercise Control's orders,

681
00:31:21,520 --> 00:31:22,520
from now on,

682
00:31:22,680 --> 00:31:25,280
please have your comms and electronic warfare units

683
00:31:25,280 --> 00:31:27,600
rapidly share all your info equipment frequencies,

684
00:31:27,600 --> 00:31:28,920
functions, and deployments,

685
00:31:29,040 --> 00:31:30,360
along with their current locations,

686
00:31:30,600 --> 00:31:31,640
to me as soon as possible.

687
00:31:31,880 --> 00:31:32,880
During this time,

688
00:31:32,880 --> 00:31:35,200
I need you to maintain full electronic silence,

689
00:31:35,240 --> 00:31:37,280
including contact with remaining combat forces.

690
00:31:38,200 --> 00:31:39,160
Understood. I'll follow your lead.

691
00:31:44,520 --> 00:31:45,160
Commander Huang,

692
00:31:46,000 --> 00:31:47,120
is this what you called

693
00:31:47,160 --> 00:31:49,080
the prime steel reserved for the blade's edge?

694
00:31:51,040 --> 00:31:52,120
A reinforced battalion

695
00:31:52,240 --> 00:31:53,760
won't even make Long Yuanshan break a sweat.

696
00:31:59,720 --> 00:32:01,280
The positioning of the Red Army's reserve

697
00:32:01,280 --> 00:32:02,520
is actually a stroke of genius.

698
00:32:03,480 --> 00:32:05,120
It doesn't seem like their style at all.

699
00:32:06,560 --> 00:32:08,440
This 399th Brigade is quite bold.

700
00:32:08,880 --> 00:32:10,360
We crippled one unit, and another one shows up.

701
00:32:11,680 --> 00:32:13,440
The pawn that crossed the river has appeared.

702
00:32:14,080 --> 00:32:16,880
Send an assault squad to track it closely right away.

703
00:32:17,280 --> 00:32:18,520
Once the target is spotted,

704
00:32:18,760 --> 00:32:20,880
suppress it with close, medium, and long-range firepower.

705
00:32:22,160 --> 00:32:24,760
I want to see how this pawn that crossed the river

706
00:32:25,240 --> 00:32:27,200
plans to face my chariots, horses, and cannons.

707
00:32:27,640 --> 00:32:28,760
Yes, sir. I'll arrange it immediately.

708
00:32:32,600 --> 00:32:33,200
Orders.

709
00:32:33,520 --> 00:32:34,360
Combat Team One,

710
00:32:34,560 --> 00:32:36,600
advance to Hill 209 north of Tiger's Mouth.

711
00:32:36,680 --> 00:32:38,440
Although this area is occupied by the Blue Army,

712
00:32:38,520 --> 00:32:40,000
our goal is to pull teeth right from the tiger's mouth.

713
00:32:40,320 --> 00:32:41,840
The key to this battle is the element of surprise.

714
00:32:41,920 --> 00:32:42,600
Stay concealed.

715
00:32:42,960 --> 00:32:43,440
Yes, sir.

716
00:32:49,840 --> 00:32:50,920
Combat Team Two,

717
00:32:50,920 --> 00:32:52,480
move along the southern section of Liuzhuang by Shigun River

718
00:32:52,480 --> 00:32:54,120
and the western section of Fangzhuang to approach the enemy covertly.

719
00:32:54,600 --> 00:32:56,040
The focus of this battle is on Tiger's Mouth

720
00:32:56,040 --> 00:32:57,760
and the Blue Army stationed at Jade Emperor Peak.

721
00:32:58,240 --> 00:32:59,520
Hit them with heavy firepower.

722
00:33:00,000 --> 00:33:01,960
The drone detachment will send a squad

723
00:33:01,960 --> 00:33:02,920
to provide you with intelligence.

724
00:33:03,400 --> 00:33:03,800
Yes, sir.

725
00:33:04,480 --> 00:33:06,240
Combat Team Three will act as the reserve,

726
00:33:06,520 --> 00:33:07,400
stationed at Liuligou

727
00:33:07,400 --> 00:33:08,680
and the Ermashan area to the south.

728
00:33:08,680 --> 00:33:09,200
Yes, sir.

729
00:33:09,880 --> 00:33:11,400
Since the mission is highly dynamic,

730
00:33:11,400 --> 00:33:12,240
Air Assault, Long-Range Artillery,

731
00:33:12,240 --> 00:33:13,120
Comms, Electronic Warfare,

732
00:33:13,120 --> 00:33:14,200
and the Special Ops Platoon

733
00:33:14,200 --> 00:33:15,440
must maintain communications with me at all times.

734
00:33:15,640 --> 00:33:16,320
Yes, sir.

735
00:33:20,680 --> 00:33:22,560
The reserve unit's position is well-chosen.

736
00:33:23,160 --> 00:33:25,440
Too bad he's up against Long Yuanshan.

737
00:33:31,640 --> 00:33:32,400
Platoon Leader!

738
00:33:32,760 --> 00:33:33,760
All units are on the move.

739
00:33:33,760 --> 00:33:34,560
What are we waiting for?

740
00:33:35,040 --> 00:33:35,720
What's the rush?

741
00:33:36,080 --> 00:33:36,560
Platoon Leader!

742
00:33:37,040 --> 00:33:37,680
The Battalion Commander is here.

743
00:33:38,280 --> 00:33:38,840
Salute!

744
00:33:42,640 --> 00:33:44,360
Commander, what brings you here in person?

745
00:33:44,400 --> 00:33:46,160
Need you ask? Our mission is critical.

746
00:33:46,480 --> 00:33:47,520
You're catching on, kid.

747
00:33:47,640 --> 00:33:48,840
Commander, if I couldn't figure that out,

748
00:33:48,840 --> 00:33:50,000
I shouldn't be the squad leader.

749
00:33:50,000 --> 00:33:51,320
Not bad. Keep it up.

750
00:33:52,280 --> 00:33:53,880
Your mission this time is very simple,

751
00:33:54,120 --> 00:33:55,160
but very important.

752
00:33:55,360 --> 00:33:56,480
We need to establish a

753
00:33:56,480 --> 00:33:58,640
real yet virtual communications command station.

754
00:33:59,200 --> 00:34:00,480
Although the equipment is simulated,

755
00:34:00,680 --> 00:34:01,960
the simulation requirements are high.

756
00:34:02,320 --> 00:34:04,040
It requires Communications and ECM,

757
00:34:04,080 --> 00:34:06,000
executed jointly by two three-man teams.

758
00:34:07,080 --> 00:34:09,040
The tactics we researched on the southeast coast this time...

759
00:34:09,520 --> 00:34:11,120
whether they are viable and effective...

760
00:34:12,480 --> 00:34:13,360
This operation

761
00:34:13,800 --> 00:34:15,520
is the best opportunity to test them.

762
00:34:15,800 --> 00:34:16,680
Are you confident?

763
00:34:16,960 --> 00:34:17,400
Yes!

764
00:34:18,080 --> 00:34:18,760
Good.

765
00:34:19,680 --> 00:34:21,560
Confidence comes from strong capabilities and competence.

766
00:34:22,040 --> 00:34:22,960
Our Yufeng Battalion

767
00:34:23,200 --> 00:34:25,360
has never conceded defeat on the battlefield.

768
00:34:25,560 --> 00:34:26,160
Staff Liang,

769
00:34:26,840 --> 00:34:28,200
I have confidence in our strength.

770
00:34:28,440 --> 00:34:29,160
I believe in you all.

771
00:34:30,520 --> 00:34:31,320
For this operation,

772
00:34:32,120 --> 00:34:34,080
the Special Ops Platoon will go with you.

773
00:34:34,400 --> 00:34:35,200
They are responsible for protection,

774
00:34:35,200 --> 00:34:37,280
while you are responsible for searching for targets,

775
00:34:37,480 --> 00:34:38,080
and

776
00:34:38,400 --> 00:34:39,960
completing the key tasks together.

777
00:34:40,360 --> 00:34:41,000
Understood?

778
00:34:41,120 --> 00:34:41,760
Understood!

779
00:34:42,360 --> 00:34:42,880
Commander,

780
00:34:43,040 --> 00:34:44,080
bringing a few little girls along...

781
00:34:44,080 --> 00:34:44,960
how do we fight this battle?

782
00:34:45,160 --> 00:34:46,360
What do you mean by 'little girls'?

783
00:34:47,000 --> 00:34:48,520
They're our battalion's precious assets.

784
00:34:48,800 --> 00:34:49,600
Let me tell you,

785
00:34:49,840 --> 00:34:51,280
the core of your mission this time

786
00:34:51,280 --> 00:34:52,680
is to ensure their safety.

787
00:34:52,920 --> 00:34:53,520
Understood!

788
00:34:53,680 --> 00:34:54,840
Mission accomplishment guaranteed!

789
00:34:55,560 --> 00:34:57,000
The helicopters can't take you too far.

790
00:34:57,000 --> 00:34:58,120
You'd be easily detected.

791
00:34:58,560 --> 00:34:59,520
So for the rest of the way,

792
00:34:59,560 --> 00:35:01,040
you'll have to rely on your own two feet.

793
00:35:01,320 --> 00:35:03,000
No matter what methods you use,

794
00:35:03,120 --> 00:35:04,600
you must keep these precious assets

795
00:35:04,600 --> 00:35:05,600
well protected for me.

796
00:35:05,800 --> 00:35:06,480
Yes, sir!

797
00:35:08,000 --> 00:35:09,880
If you encounter an insurmountable obstacle,

798
00:35:10,000 --> 00:35:10,960
sacrifice yourselves

799
00:35:11,240 --> 00:35:12,160
to save your comrades.

800
00:35:12,160 --> 00:35:12,920
Sacrifice ourselves?

801
00:35:13,000 --> 00:35:14,800
Without us Special Forces, how do we fight this battle?

802
00:35:15,600 --> 00:35:17,200
Remember our Value Cube?

803
00:35:17,760 --> 00:35:19,240
The 'little girls' you mentioned

804
00:35:19,240 --> 00:35:20,320
are exactly

805
00:35:20,440 --> 00:35:21,520
the core of the cube for this mission.

806
00:36:08,960 --> 00:36:09,400
Report.

807
00:36:09,680 --> 00:36:10,120
Go ahead.

808
00:36:10,240 --> 00:36:11,200
We just intercepted

809
00:36:11,200 --> 00:36:11,880
the Red Army reserve's

810
00:36:11,880 --> 00:36:13,440
communication frequency with the Red Army command post,

811
00:36:13,600 --> 00:36:15,280
but it was too brief to track.

812
00:36:16,080 --> 00:36:16,960
There's just one strange thing.

813
00:36:16,960 --> 00:36:17,640
Get to the point.

814
00:36:17,920 --> 00:36:19,640
All of the Red Army's communications have been cut off.

815
00:36:19,880 --> 00:36:20,440
They've gone radio silent.

816
00:36:20,440 --> 00:36:20,800
Yes, sir.

817
00:36:21,480 --> 00:36:22,160
Monitor them closely.

818
00:36:22,160 --> 00:36:22,600
Yes, sir.

819
00:36:24,120 --> 00:36:26,000
Radio silence means one of three things.

820
00:36:26,680 --> 00:36:28,640
First, they fear our heavy electromagnetic jamming.

821
00:36:28,840 --> 00:36:30,360
Second, they fear being tracked down by us.

822
00:36:30,480 --> 00:36:31,040
Third,

823
00:36:31,400 --> 00:36:33,600
there are new deployments

824
00:36:34,080 --> 00:36:35,040
for their combat troops and command elements.

825
00:36:35,760 --> 00:36:36,800
It's obviously the third one.

826
00:36:37,320 --> 00:36:38,840
And to coordinate with this reserve force,

827
00:36:38,840 --> 00:36:40,320
the entire Red Army's communication and command system

828
00:36:40,320 --> 00:36:41,520
is providing full support.

829
00:36:43,280 --> 00:36:45,120
It's highly likely that this reserve force

830
00:36:45,800 --> 00:36:48,680
is preparing a fatal strike.

831
00:36:50,600 --> 00:36:52,000
We've reached this stage of the battle,

832
00:36:52,400 --> 00:36:53,720
what kind of fatal strike could they have left?

833
00:36:54,280 --> 00:36:55,280
Order the assault squad

834
00:36:55,600 --> 00:36:56,560
to expand their search area.

835
00:36:56,920 --> 00:36:58,040
I don't believe

836
00:36:58,400 --> 00:37:00,000
a combined arms battalion

837
00:37:00,000 --> 00:37:01,680
can hide its tracks from me.

838
00:37:02,240 --> 00:37:02,920
I'll deploy them immediately.

839
00:37:09,040 --> 00:37:09,440
Report.

840
00:37:11,040 --> 00:37:11,360
Captain.

841
00:37:12,080 --> 00:37:12,680
These two

842
00:37:13,080 --> 00:37:14,760
are assault members from the 399th Brigade.

843
00:37:15,040 --> 00:37:15,760
They were scattered,

844
00:37:16,000 --> 00:37:16,640
but managed to survive.

845
00:37:19,200 --> 00:37:20,240
That's great.

846
00:37:20,920 --> 00:37:22,600
Which battalion of the 399th Brigade are you from?

847
00:37:22,760 --> 00:37:23,440
Sir!

848
00:37:23,520 --> 00:37:25,200
We're from the 9th Company, 3rd Combined Arms Battalion.

849
00:37:25,440 --> 00:37:26,560
I know, I know.

850
00:37:27,520 --> 00:37:29,520
Your 9th Company Commander, Xu Zhiqiang...

851
00:37:29,920 --> 00:37:30,880
We know each other very well.

852
00:37:31,640 --> 00:37:32,960
We attended training together.

853
00:37:33,040 --> 00:37:34,240
Even shared the same dorm.

854
00:37:35,400 --> 00:37:36,200
How is he doing now?

855
00:37:36,600 --> 00:37:37,440
Don't tell me he was eliminated too.

856
00:37:37,920 --> 00:37:38,960
Our Commander Xu

857
00:37:38,960 --> 00:37:41,080
had escaped with two infantry fighting vehicles,

858
00:37:41,400 --> 00:37:43,160
but was spotted by the enemy's assault squad.

859
00:37:43,640 --> 00:37:44,640
He didn't make it in the end.

860
00:37:45,080 --> 00:37:45,840
That's a shame.

861
00:37:47,720 --> 00:37:48,760
Where are they now?

862
00:37:50,360 --> 00:37:51,840
Just over that hill ahead.

863
00:37:52,200 --> 00:37:53,520
Is there any surviving equipment left?

864
00:37:53,840 --> 00:37:55,120
There's one infantry fighting vehicle

865
00:37:55,240 --> 00:37:56,360
and one assault gun vehicle,

866
00:37:56,480 --> 00:37:57,720
along with over 20 comrades.

867
00:37:58,600 --> 00:37:59,120
Good.

868
00:37:59,520 --> 00:38:00,080
Excellent.

869
00:38:00,760 --> 00:38:01,840
Go contact them immediately.

870
00:38:02,040 --> 00:38:02,800
We'll head over shortly.

871
00:38:03,080 --> 00:38:03,560
Yes, sir.

872
00:38:06,600 --> 00:38:07,280
Assemble the troops.

873
00:38:07,440 --> 00:38:08,120
We depart immediately.

874
00:38:08,400 --> 00:38:08,760
Yes, sir.

875
00:38:11,320 --> 00:38:12,600
You two be careful on the way.

876
00:38:12,880 --> 00:38:14,320
Get two men to tail them.

877
00:38:14,440 --> 00:38:14,720
Yes, sir.

878
00:38:21,040 --> 00:38:21,920
How did you encounter them?

879
00:38:22,880 --> 00:38:24,200
They were discovered by our scouts.

880
00:38:24,840 --> 00:38:25,920
I've already checked.

881
00:38:26,360 --> 00:38:27,200
What they're wearing

882
00:38:27,640 --> 00:38:29,880
and their insignias are indeed from the 399th Brigade.

883
00:38:30,880 --> 00:38:32,080
But when you questioned them just now,

884
00:38:32,760 --> 00:38:33,600
they gave themselves away.

885
00:38:33,920 --> 00:38:35,480
The 399th Brigade suffered heavy losses this time.

886
00:38:36,000 --> 00:38:37,520
A large portion of their heavy equipment

887
00:38:37,760 --> 00:38:39,360
was destroyed by small squads like this.

888
00:38:40,000 --> 00:38:41,720
They rely on their familiarity with the terrain.

889
00:38:42,120 --> 00:38:43,480
Small in number and highly mobile,

890
00:38:44,120 --> 00:38:44,640
they're very hard to deal with.

891
00:38:46,200 --> 00:38:47,160
Then why did you let them go?

892
00:38:48,320 --> 00:38:49,320
I was just wondering

893
00:38:49,680 --> 00:38:50,840
how to attract

894
00:38:50,840 --> 00:38:52,120
Long Yuanshan's attention,

895
00:38:53,400 --> 00:38:55,080
and he delivered himself right to our door.

896
00:38:55,120 --> 00:38:56,200
What should we do about the company

897
00:38:56,200 --> 00:38:57,640
that appeared near Tiger's Mouth?

898
00:38:59,440 --> 00:39:01,040
Judging from the intel brought back by the scouts,

899
00:39:01,600 --> 00:39:02,920
it is indeed a reinforced company.

900
00:39:03,360 --> 00:39:03,880
Staff Officer Liu!

901
00:39:04,280 --> 00:39:04,680
Sir!

902
00:39:05,440 --> 00:39:06,280
Order the Recon Battalion

903
00:39:06,280 --> 00:39:08,520
to immediately search the area around Tiger's Mouth.

904
00:39:08,520 --> 00:39:08,880
Yes, sir!

905
00:39:10,440 --> 00:39:11,880
Tiger's Mouth, as a Red Army position,

906
00:39:11,880 --> 00:39:13,240
is now of absolutely no value.

907
00:39:13,520 --> 00:39:15,240
What is this reinforced company doing there?

908
00:39:15,360 --> 00:39:16,080
There are two possibilities.

909
00:39:16,800 --> 00:39:17,240
First,

910
00:39:17,240 --> 00:39:19,200
the 1st and 2nd Battalions didn't clear the battlefield thoroughly,

911
00:39:19,560 --> 00:39:21,840
and there are still personnel and equipment left behind.

912
00:39:22,320 --> 00:39:22,920
Second,

913
00:39:23,080 --> 00:39:25,840
Tiger's Mouth is the central area of the exercise field.

914
00:39:26,200 --> 00:39:28,360
No matter which direction they strike from,

915
00:39:28,520 --> 00:39:29,760
it would be highly advantageous.

916
00:39:30,360 --> 00:39:31,560
I'll immediately order the 1st and 2nd Battalions

917
00:39:31,560 --> 00:39:32,400
to expand their search area.

918
00:39:32,400 --> 00:39:33,920
If spotted, annihilate them on the spot.

919
00:39:38,760 --> 00:39:41,480
Is this really the killer move they came up with?

920
00:39:42,840 --> 00:39:45,080
Trying to turn the tide with just one reinforced company?

921
00:39:45,760 --> 00:39:47,800
They severely underestimate me, Long Yuanshan.

922
00:39:48,000 --> 00:39:50,720
Although the Red Army reserves went into total radio silence,

923
00:39:51,680 --> 00:39:53,560
they have neither tactics nor a sound strategy.

924
00:39:54,640 --> 00:39:56,080
They're just delaying the inevitable.

925
00:40:06,680 --> 00:40:07,800
Platoon Leader Yang, we have a situation.

926
00:40:08,040 --> 00:40:08,560
Stay alert.

927
00:40:18,000 --> 00:40:19,160
I finally caught you.

928
00:40:20,120 --> 00:40:20,720
Comrades.

929
00:40:20,960 --> 00:40:22,000
Team One, pinpoint the location.

930
00:40:22,120 --> 00:40:23,080
Team Two, capture the frequency.

931
00:40:25,720 --> 00:40:26,360
Ma Zhengzheng.

932
00:40:26,560 --> 00:40:26,880
Here.

933
00:40:27,080 --> 00:40:28,080
Night vision binoculars.

934
00:40:38,240 --> 00:40:38,800
Staff Officer Liang.

935
00:40:39,200 --> 00:40:39,560
Here!

936
00:40:41,160 --> 00:40:43,120
Is my plan too risky?

937
00:40:45,680 --> 00:40:46,400
Not really.

938
00:40:47,160 --> 00:40:48,520
There's no problem with the plan itself.

939
00:40:49,400 --> 00:40:50,800
If it were a couple of years ago,

940
00:40:51,040 --> 00:40:52,280
it would've been highly unlikely.

941
00:40:52,280 --> 00:40:54,640
But the technology is much more mature now,

942
00:40:55,520 --> 00:40:56,680
and partially implemented.

943
00:40:56,760 --> 00:40:58,120
So it's good to put it into practice.

944
00:40:59,240 --> 00:41:00,720
If this battle is a success,

945
00:41:01,120 --> 00:41:03,440
the commanders might ask you for the underlying principles.

946
00:41:03,640 --> 00:41:04,280
What will you say?

947
00:41:04,960 --> 00:41:06,040
Reporting to the commanders,

948
00:41:06,040 --> 00:41:07,120
isn't that your job?

949
00:41:07,200 --> 00:41:08,000
That won't do.

950
00:41:08,320 --> 00:41:09,760
This is your show this time.

951
00:41:10,240 --> 00:41:11,440
I don't care about that.

952
00:41:12,880 --> 00:41:13,920
Then what do you care about?

953
00:41:18,520 --> 00:41:19,480
What I care about is,

954
00:41:19,600 --> 00:41:21,320
Hong Xiafei and Yang Maolin have been out for a while.

955
00:41:21,320 --> 00:41:23,160
Shouldn't they have sent some intel back by now?

956
00:41:25,080 --> 00:41:25,640
Reporting, Squad Leader!

957
00:41:25,640 --> 00:41:26,960
Coordinates accurate. Image capture complete.

958
00:41:27,160 --> 00:41:27,920
Good job.

959
00:41:28,760 --> 00:41:30,600
I'll send the parameters to the command post right away.

960
00:41:31,240 --> 00:41:31,880
Wait a minute.

961
00:41:32,640 --> 00:41:33,400
We can't wait any longer.

962
00:41:33,720 --> 00:41:34,680
We're running out of time.

963
00:41:35,520 --> 00:41:36,400
Something's not right.

964
00:41:37,640 --> 00:41:39,720
This command post is likely a fake, too.

965
00:41:41,280 --> 00:41:42,120
That's impossible.

966
00:41:44,000 --> 00:41:45,720
Knowing Brigade Commander Long,

967
00:41:46,040 --> 00:41:46,840
he would never

968
00:41:46,840 --> 00:41:48,360
set up a command post so conspicuously

969
00:41:48,680 --> 00:41:51,280
that we could easily spot it with night vision.

970
00:41:51,760 --> 00:41:52,360
Platoon Leader.

971
00:41:52,720 --> 00:41:53,440
At a time like this,

972
00:41:53,440 --> 00:41:54,160
you can't keep...

973
00:41:54,160 --> 00:41:54,800
Cut the crap.

974
00:41:56,720 --> 00:41:57,840
If that's really the case,

975
00:41:58,040 --> 00:41:58,920
then we're doomed.

976
00:41:59,280 --> 00:42:00,200
We'd rather be late,

977
00:42:00,520 --> 00:42:01,440
but we must be accurate.

978
00:42:02,000 --> 00:42:03,120
This is our special ops platoon's

979
00:42:03,120 --> 00:42:04,920
core principle for intelligence operations.

980
00:42:05,320 --> 00:42:05,840
Also,

981
00:42:06,800 --> 00:42:08,440
if we provide a false target,

982
00:42:08,920 --> 00:42:10,600
then all decisions made by the command post

983
00:42:10,800 --> 00:42:11,960
will be built on an illusion.

984
00:42:12,240 --> 00:42:13,000
So what do we do?

985
00:42:14,520 --> 00:42:16,880
Judging from how busy the female soldiers were,

986
00:42:17,240 --> 00:42:19,120
this should be an intelligence processing station,

987
00:42:19,200 --> 00:42:21,440
deliberately disguised as a command post.

988
00:42:22,320 --> 00:42:23,040
Besides,

989
00:42:23,440 --> 00:42:25,160
the guards are positioned perfectly.

990
00:42:26,000 --> 00:42:26,640
My guess is

991
00:42:27,160 --> 00:42:29,720
the real command post isn't far from here.

992
00:42:30,520 --> 00:42:32,080
No more than two kilometers at most.

993
00:42:32,840 --> 00:42:33,800
Are you sure?

994
00:42:35,440 --> 00:42:36,480
About eighty percent sure.

995
00:42:39,440 --> 00:42:40,160
Let's cut the chatter.

996
00:42:40,520 --> 00:42:41,120
Let's move out.

997
00:42:41,160 --> 00:42:41,640
Let's go.

998
00:42:48,160 --> 00:42:48,600
What's wrong?

999
00:42:48,960 --> 00:42:49,560
Are you okay?

1000
00:42:50,520 --> 00:42:51,720
I think I sprained my ankle.
